c &=3 \times10^{8} \mathrm{ m}/ \mathrm{s}
\end{aligned}$ Hence, after putting numerical values, we obtain $\begin{aligned} p &=\frac{1 \times 10^{6} \times 1.6 \times 10^{-19}}{3 \times 10^{8}} \mathrm{ kg}-\mathrm{m}/ \mathrm{s}\\
&=5 \times10^{-22} \mathrm{ kg}-\mathrm{m}/ \mathrm{s}
\end{aligned}$

